  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_04:1_5_024_04:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_04:1_5_024_04:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_04:1_5_024_04:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_04:1_5_024_04:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a32ab155fc35bb9d00324d4546ae97b26f5c872119a9771e119d3caaa3afcf0",
      "text": "青春乐队电影的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_04:1_5_024_04:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:039fd364d684cb8f8d070c016686429a572f8470a2cc73dfbd70e89870646447",
      "text": "“要是那么不顺利，稍微休息一下怎么样？\n现在的你，看上去一点都不开心”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_04:1_5_024_04:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a9acdfd856fdc51c62f28c2451c866e82d6974b8a0b865ce71a538062a9f37c",
      "text": "“离正式演出没多少时间了，我也明白。\n但是，继续这样下去的话……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_04:1_5_024_04:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f08bf3a8d53c37770e1e8ee22de9274e7bfed1cfcaddbbd7c915cda778bf1223",
      "text": "唔——刚才那段，是不是语气再强硬一点\n会比较好呢……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_04:1_5_024_04:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e594def3951e15d54613bd6d7e340934d21d24e494e40f0a25cba12ee5bbd017",
      "text": "辛苦了。我带了慰问品来……\n您表情这么严肃，是遇到什么难题了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_04:1_5_024_04:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff97195a357fb1841f860fc6a6a4a6243e47e62448d8f6b8ec201665829cfd60",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー酱。关于下次要出演的\n青春乐队电影的角色演法……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_04:1_5_024_04:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c99717ed8d8bce3813f41c860efd7a3daa852a93f99740985c128c40c2c9eed5",
      "text": "我自己也搞乐队，一开始还觉得挺轻松的，\n但怎么说呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_04:1_5_024_04:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b37558dc294664e26dbba4566716403c0b33848a441d31de8a9113cf6ade8fbc",
      "text": "正因为感同身受，反而会有独特的难处，\n四季先生是在为这个纠结吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_04:1_5_024_04:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:433c45260b34e2790688ca6d8f5ccfd7046960d8292b7683fe3e56b3821ea929",
      "text": "没说错！到底该怎么演，\n我Mega Mega迷茫啊～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_04:1_5_024_04:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad3b4cda63a9e1942290a87a559e46078f1a4ff0b6f90b1f12ef47dfeb3e61d0",
      "text": "既然这样，要不要再把角色挖掘得更深一些呢？\n我也来帮忙！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_04:1_5_024_04:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:763f64c1eec43c4ea06fe0e42d19ee21af879937c24d194cceece6d0e068682b",
      "text": "那可帮了大忙了！\n谢啦，●●●●プロデューサー酱！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
